test_memquota_hook tests plan_mem_intensive_ops_hook (src/include/cdb/memquota.h),
through which an extension says how many memory-intensive operators a plan
node counts as when the memory policy splits the statement's memory.

The module counts each Sort as test_memquota_hook.sort_ops operators, and
reports the operatorMemKB the policy gave each node of the plan as the query
starts on the coordinator, which is where the memory is assigned.
